{
  "description": "The image shows a single large, muscular four-legged felid standing in right-facing side profile with its head turned to face the viewer. Its coat is predominantly tawny golden-brown with a paler off-white underbelly, chest, throat and chin, overlaid with faint to distinct narrow dark stripes. It has a broad head with a short muzzle, small rounded ears, a shaggy ruff of longer fur around the neck and chest, four sturdy legs ending in large paws, and a short thin tail with a dark tip. The animal is rendered in detailed naturalistic style against a plain off-white background with a soft shadow beneath its feet, resembling a vintage scientific illustration.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "broad felid head at the front of the body, turned three-quarters toward the viewer; tawny fur with white on the muzzle, chin and around the eyes, a dark pink-brown nose, white whiskers, and amber-brown eyes with dark outlines; forehead and crown show faint dark spotting and narrow striping",
      "where": "at the front end of the torso, above the chest ruff"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two small rounded tufted ears with tawny fur and a distinct dark brown-black patch on the back of each ear",
      "where": "on top of the head, one on each side"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "shaggy medium-length ruff of longer, tousled fur, tawny mixed with off-white and light brown, thicker and more textured than the short body fur",
      "where": "encircling the neck, extending down the throat and over the upper chest and underside of the neck"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four thick muscular legs covered in short tawny fur with prominent dark horizontal bands on the lower segments, especially distinct on the hind legs; forelegs are straight and vertical, hind legs are slightly bent at the hock",
      "where": "two forelegs under the chest, two hind legs under the rear torso, supporting the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four large rounded paws with visible toe pads and short dark claws, fur is lighter tawny on the paws with darker shading between toes",
      "where": "at the bottom ends of each leg, flat on the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "short thin tail with tawny fur, several dark rings and a dark blackish tuft at the tip",
      "where": "protruding from the rear of the body, extending slightly outward behind the right hind leg"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "narrow dark brown to black vertical stripes and bars, fainter and more diffuse on the back and sides, more distinct and band-like on the lower legs and tail; small dark spots on the forehead and around the muzzle",
      "where": "across the torso, flanks, hindquarters, limbs and tail, and on the face"
    }
  ],
